    <data key="d0">American Commercial Barge Line Serverless Modernization Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iwDNnyiD26M</data>
    <data key="d2">Serverless modernization pattern using AppSync, Cognito, Lambda, and DynamoDB single-table design.</data>
